      "usb_cable": {
        "basis": "No VBUS input is known for the X-T3: its key table has no USB row and the stock USB task reads the condition register at 0xfff4a300, which follows the cable. Bank 15 pin 15 is a declared pin no stock key row reads; a host negotiates high speed.",
